      "t": "Visiting Nastya's father at his meatpacking plant to apologize for their last fight, Kostya gets goaded into showing how he threw the punch and accidentally breaks her father's nose all over again. Back at the restaurant, Max tells Chef Barinov that he registered him on the social network and added Elena.",
